<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for further 25,000 tonnes barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for further 25,000 tonnes barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it invited tenders for 25,000 tonnes of feed barley, with tenders closing January 17 and shipment in early February.</p>
<p>The tender is in addition to one for a similar amount of feed barley, closing January 17 and for shipment between January 22 and February 5.</p>
</text>
